      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Small field but it should be a good contest. ANDRON (3) is going through the grades nicely this prep. Scored at Hawkesbury two back then jumped quickly from 1800m to 2400m and recorded a tough all-the-way win at Rosehill. Meets a similar line-up today - will give them something to catch again. NKOSI (2) also went up 600m in trip last start and found the task at the third run back too great, beaten 2.2 lengths by ANDRON. Enjoys a big weight swing today and the in-form Zac Lloyd takes the reins. Ready to find form. CRITERIA (4) finished a close third in the ANDRON race last start after travelling handy for the entire journey. Meets him 2.5kgs better for a 0.7 length margin. Cherry ripe and capable of taking this out. SAVVY SPY (5) came with a well-timed run to win with a bit in hand at Hawkesbury recently. New to this trip but should get it on breeding. SONIC BENDER (6) was beaten under a length by ANDRON last time and is sure to measure up again.",
